{"id":"l6gbjqqhliepjlgronwov64wz","title":"日本电视台靠老年观众撑住广告收入","originalTitle":"日本电视台，被老人救活了","summary":"日本电视媒体广告费在2025年下降0.3%，而美国同行业广告收入预计下降7%。日本电视台守住广告收入，得益于老年观众的高消费力和对电视的忠诚度。广告主愿意为覆盖全国一半消费市场而支付更高的广告费用。此外，网络广告的乱象也帮助电视广告维持了市场份额。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"钛媒体"},"links":{"original":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8202109.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T03:31:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:08.665Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T03:41:08.665Z","category":"stock-asia-tech","tags":["行情异动","研究报告"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"好望角","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}